": "", "id": 3, "text": "<strong>Brian Rose: </strong> I keep the room closed, because I want people to have a peaceful stay. But the ghosts don't hurt anybody. People have seen the little girl playing, and sometimes they hear laughter. People come to my hotel so that they can try to see the ghosts."}, {"time": "59000", "image": "", "id": 4, "text": "<strong> Interviewer: </strong> Well, I'm sure our readers will enjoy the story! Mr. Rose, thank you for your time. And stay safe!"}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 2, "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "frn5le01ob12re2img01.jpg"}], "title": "", "type": "text", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 3, "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "frn5le01ob12re3img01.jpg"}], "title": "", "type": "text", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 4, "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "frn5le01ob12re3img02.jpg"}], "title": "", "type": "text", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 6, "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "frn5le01ob12re6img01.jpg"}], "title": "", "type": "text", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 7, "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "frn5le01ob12re6img02.jpg"}], "title": "", "type": "text", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 8, "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "frn5le01ob12re2img02.jpg"}], "title": "", "type": "text", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 9, "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "frn5le01ob12re5img01.jpg"}], "title": "", "type": "text", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 10, "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "frn5le01ob12re5img02.jpg", "audiosrc": "frn5le01ob12re5aud01", "images": []}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Il y a <span class=\"strong\">10 \u00e0 15 questions</span>. Il n'y a pas de limite de temps.", "type"